---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout title="Returns & Refunds">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-[#0b1516] py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1
          class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white md:text-5xl"
        >
          Returns & Refunds.
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-[#36f4a4] uppercase">
          Last Updated: October 15, 2025
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 leading-relaxed font-light text-[#dae5e6]/70">
        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white"
          >
            The 30-Day Window
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We accept returns on eligible products within exactly 30 days of the
            delivery date. To initiate a return, contact our support team to
            acquire a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number.
            Unauthorized returns sent to our warehouse will be rejected and
            returned to sender.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white"
          >
            Condition Requirements & Margins
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Because we operate on compressed margins to offer you wholesale
            pricing, we must strictly enforce condition requirements:
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>
              <strong class="font-medium text-white"
                >Unopened / Factory Sealed:</strong
              > Eligible for a 100% full refund to the original payment method.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="font-medium text-white"
                >Opened / Used (Undamaged):</strong
              > Subject to a strict <span
                class="font-mono font-bold text-[#36f4a4]"
                >15% Restocking Fee</span
              >. We cannot sell opened electronics as new.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="font-medium text-white"
                >Damaged / Missing Parts:</strong
              > Rejected. Not eligible for a refund.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-white"
          >
            Refund Processing
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Once your return is received at our logistics center, it undergoes a
            48-hour hardware inspection. Once cleared, the refund (minus any
            applicable restocking fees) is immediately transmitted to Stripe.
            Depending on your bank's clearing cycles, funds will appear in your
            account within 5-10 business days.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
